    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "#Welcome! \n\nToday, you will generate images and write code to create a unique project!",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI26-Playtest1-Intro-7c11e75b-3129-4f2d-8087-1fde8888b041",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "#You choose!\nFirst, you will choose to create either a GAME or a STORY.\n",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI26-Playtest1-Intro-73a3b74d-66a9-4f4b-a1e0-943291e2b1aa",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Use AI to generate images\n\n- **Write a prompt** to describe the image you want AI to generate.\n\n- **Choose which style** you'd like, smooth or pixel art.\n\n- **Press Generate, and then decide if you want to Accept, or change the image.**",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/73eeea3caf5b114b6e810e8e21ebecb4-imageGenPanel2.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-Playtest1-Intro-1ba65752-8425-465c-9a85-d972f45f4102",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Use code to create your project\n\n- **Add Sprites** as characters, players, platforms and objects\n\n- **Add Events** to control timing and reactions\n\n- Work up to **switching the direction of gravity or zoom level**!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/26d20127b54879d70ff6f58dd40c649a-CodePanel.png",
        "key": "HoAI26-Playtest1-Intro-d32b314e-6b91-447e-8f33-bea577296393"
      }
    ],
